OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 14, among arrests as axe and
OL,4,Amachete seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve people have been arrested and
OL,7,Fweapons seized during a police
OL,8,Foperation targeting violence and
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FThe activity took place in north
OL,12,FLiverpool, where officers carried out
OL,13,Fextra patrols, including 70 stop
OL,14,Fsearches on Thursday and Friday.
OL,16,FBoys aged 14 and 16 were among those
OL,17,Fdetained after officers recovered an
OL,18,Faxe and machete, while other arrests
OL,19,Fwere linked to suspected drug offences.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
