OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 14, among arrests as axe and
OL,4,Amachete seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsp Sean Harrison said: "These results
OL,7,Fshould send a clear message to anyone
OL,8,Fcarrying weapons, dealing drugs, or
OL,9,Fengaging in criminality in our
OL,10,Fcommunities that we will take robust
OL,11,Faction and bring offenders before the
OL,12,Fcourts."
